<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka buys 12,500T sugar at $347 per tonne.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka buys 12,500T sugar at $347 per tonne.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's state buying arm, the Co-operative Wholesale Establishment, bought 12,500 tonnes of white refined sugar from Kerry Foodstuffs (Pvt) Ltd of Singapore at $347 per tonne C and F, government officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The purchase through a tender is for shipment before November 5, they said.</p>
</text>
